---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Plan a Trip',href:'/plan-a-trip/'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Plan a Group Trip | Talon Expeditions" description="Start planning a private group, active, trekking, learn-to, cultural, cruise, or hosted trip with Talon Expeditions. A finished itinerary is not required." image={images.boat} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="page-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.boat}')`}><div class="shell"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/><p class="eyebrow">Plan a trip</p><h1 class="section-title">Tell us what you are trying to create. We will start with the real constraints.</h1><p>You do not need a final destination, headcount, budget, or itinerary. The planning inquiry is designed to capture enough context for a useful first conversation, not to make you solve the trip before contacting us.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell contact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you submit</p><h2 class="section-title">The most useful information is usually simple.</h2><p class="section-copy">If you know the group, dates, activity, destination, or approximate budget, include it. If you do not, explain what the group wants to experience and what would make the trip successful.</p><div class="contact-card" style="margin-top:28px"><strong>Useful starting details</strong><div class="check-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-bottom:0"><span>Who the travelers are</span><span>Approximate group size</span><span>Preferred dates or season</span><span>Trip style or activity</span><span>Destination ideas, if any</span><span>Approximate budget range</span><span>Experience or fitness level</span><span>Any fixed constraints</span></div></div></div><form data-mailto-form data-subject="New Talon Expeditions planning inquiry" class="form-panel contact-form" action="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><div><label for="plan-name">Your name</label><input id="plan-name" name="name" required/></div><div><label for="plan-email">Email</label><input id="plan-email" name="email" type="email" required/></div><div><label for="plan-phone">Phone</label><input id="plan-phone" name="phone" type="tel"/></div><div><label for="plan-org">Organization / group</label><input id="plan-org" name="organization"/></div><div><label for="plan-type">Group type</label><select id="plan-type" name="group-type"><option>Private group / friends</option><option>Club or community</option><option>Hiking / outdoor group</option><option>Dive / watersports community</option><option>Wellness / studio group</option><option>Business / team</option><option>Social / affinity group</option><option>Individual / public departure</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for="plan-size">Approximate group size</label><input id="plan-size" name="group-size" placeholder="Example: 10–16"/></div><div><label for="plan-dates">Dates / season</label><input id="plan-dates" name="dates" placeholder="Example: September 2027"/></div><div><label for="plan-budget">Approximate budget</label><input id="plan-budget" name="budget" placeholder="Per traveler or total"/></div><div class="full"><label for="plan-trip">Trip idea</label><textarea id="plan-trip" name="trip-idea" required placeholder="Where do you want to go, what do you want to do, or what kind of experience are you trying to create?"></textarea></div><div class="full"><label for="plan-notes">Anything else we should know?</label><textarea id="plan-notes" name="notes" placeholder="Activity level, rooming, traveler origins, accessibility, timing, existing reservations, or other constraints."></textarea></div><div class="full"><button class="button" type="submit">Send Planning Inquiry</button><p class="form-note">Prefer to email directly? Send the same details to sales@talonexpeditions.com.</p></div></form></div></section>
  <section class="section soft-section"><div class="shell"><div class="specialty-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What happens next</p><h2 class="section-title">The first response should move the trip forward.</h2></div><p class="section-copy">We review the inquiry, identify the biggest open questions, and determine whether the trip fits the Talon Expeditions model before asking you for more detail.</p></div><div class="process-number-grid"><div class="process-number"><span>01</span><h3>Review</h3><p>We read the actual group and trip context rather than treating the inquiry as a generic quote request.</p></div><div class="process-number"><span>02</span><h3>Clarify</h3><p>We identify the few decisions that most affect viability, destination fit, scope, and pricing.</p></div><div class="process-number"><span>03</span><h3>Plan</h3><p>If the trip is a fit, we move into destination comparison, itinerary design, supplier work, and group assumptions.</p></div><div class="process-number"><span>04</span><h3>Propose</h3><p>When enough is known, the trip moves into a concrete proposal with clearer inclusions, terms, and next steps.</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
